{"2914150":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Yunyun Syndrome!? Rhythm Psychosis","steam_appid":2914150,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"dlc":[4535490,4535510,4535520,4535530,4535540,4535550,4535570,5253050,5253060],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High and vibin’ with denpa songs, we’ll corrupt the entire Internet! Hehe. all we need is a bit of otaku love, that’s all. <\/strong> <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a rhythm-adventure game where you play as a hikikomori (shut-in) girl who’s high on denpa songs. Become Yunyun-brained and lose all self-control to anonymously post on social media and destroy the world with your Yunyun brain rot.  <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have a Doki-Doki experience with <strong><i>over 30 denpa songs and multiple endings.<\/i><\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2914150\/extras\/36ac65afd4a20c0b11e703b1eec7990e.poster.avif?t=1791513577\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2914150\/extras\/36ac65afd4a20c0b11e703b1eec7990e.webm?t=1791513577\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2914150\/extras\/36ac65afd4a20c0b11e703b1eec7990e.mp4?t=1791513577\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Q. Why did she become a hikikomori?<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Q. How does anonymous online posting lead to world destruction?  <br>Q. Does a happy ending exist for a degenerate otaku?    <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The answers to those “Q” s lie at the convergence of insanity and denpa psychosis.  <br>Now, put those headphones on and become ill with Yunyun Syndrome!? Rhythm Psychosis.   <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>⚡ Anonymously post online and infect the whole world with Yunyun-brain! <\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get high on denpa songs and spread your heartful psychosis to everyone else!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2914150\/extras\/136a0f8c1653810b0fdd8e95342c316b.poster.avif?t=1791513577\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2914150\/extras\/136a0f8c1653810b0fdd8e95342c316b.webm?t=1791513577\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2914150\/extras\/136a0f8c1653810b0fdd8e95342c316b.mp4?t=1791513577\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>⚡Characters! <\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>・Qtie (CV:Nanahira)<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main character. A hikikomori. She suffered too much irl that she’s become a little (very) fuzzy in the head. Her obsessive love for the fictional character “Yunyun” is for sure an illness. Her overly “high” state from overdosing denpa songs causes her to propagate Yunyun love. Will there really be a happy end for such a degenerate otaku? <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2914150\/extras\/bb3e0b8feb0628a43c4ec4be2381c725.poster.avif?t=1791513577\" width=500 height=330 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2914150\/extras\/bb3e0b8feb0628a43c4ec4be2381c725.webm?t=1791513577\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2914150\/extras\/bb3e0b8feb0628a43c4ec4be2381c725.mp4?t=1791513577\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>・Yunyun (CV:Haruko Momoi)<\/strong><br>A fictional character that loves Qtie. A very much angelic devil. She will speak to Qtie through the monitor screen. Whilst the truth is unknown, most likely, she is just a figment of Qtie's imagination. It’s joever for her.   <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2914150\/extras\/fe57b3b4e45aaada09e302e11873dc27.poster.avif?t=1791513577\" width=586 height=330 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2914150\/extras\/fe57b3b4e45aaada09e302e11873dc27.webm?t=1791513577\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2914150\/extras\/fe57b3b4e45aaada09e302e11873dc27.mp4?t=1791513577\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>⚡About DenpaSongs! <\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Q. What is a “denpa” song? <br>It is a genre of music that is intentionally strange and catchy. All playable songs in this game are denpa songs.  <br>Many popular denpa songs such as “it’s a cherry kissing explosion” (Sakuranbo Kiss) and many more are featured!   <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >▶Original Songs<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1.Denpa-tic Imaginary Girl &quot;Q&quot;<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2.Peak Ecstasy!! Rim de Lacent☆<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3.YUNYUN HARDCORE<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4.???<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5.???<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >▶Licensed Songs<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6.Achichi na Natsu no Monogatari<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7.Change my Style~Anata gonomi no Watashi ni~<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8.Cirno's Perfect Math Class<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9.CosmicKING☆sens@tion!!!!!!!!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10.Dakko Shite Gyu!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >11.Gacha Gacha Cute Figu@mate<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12.INTERNET OVERDOSE<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >13.INTERNET YAMERO<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >14.Kanbu de Tomatte sugu Tokeru Kyoki no Udongein<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15.Kyururun Kiss de Janbo♪♪<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >16.Love Cheat!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >17.Marisa stole the precious thing<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >18.Mighty Heart ~Aru Hi no Kenka, Itsumo no Koigokoro~<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >19.Miko Miko Nurse - Ai no Theme<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20.Nee,...shiyou yo!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >21.PETTAN PETTAN TSURUPETTAN<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >22.Princess Brave!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >23.Princess Bride!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >24.Raspberry<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >25.sakuranbokissu~bakuhatsudamo~n~<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >26.Senno Sakushu Tora no Maki<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >27.Shukusei!! Loli Kami Requiem<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >28.summer is machine gun<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >29.true my heart<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30.winter is machine gun<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >31.MuseDashを作っているPeroPeroGamesさんが倒産しちゃったよ～<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >32.MEGA TSKR<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >33.Mecha Koi Ranman☆<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >34.RORO JUMP! (feat. CHiNCHiYA)<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >35.Strawberry Cake<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >36.Quit being a maid? Quit being a human?<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>♥Listen up! <\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you like cute anime girls? Do you like strange and catchy denpa songs? Do you wish for the death of this ♡♡♡♡ed up world? Great! Add “Yunyun Syndrome!? 